editor_description = "RL-8 Barrage: dorsal clearance-and-turn rocket launcher. Existing eight cell origins eject world +Y; the salvo captures one world-space firing solution, each rocket turns finitely then flies straight. Edit rl8_barrage.tres > ordnance for clearance height, eject speed, orient rate, transition timeout, lifetime, travel and model values. Salvo timing and existing placeholder tube layout are editable here. Install at identity on a rocket hardpoint."
